    "html": "<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Bobbing for Isaacs </h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-hook\">hook: Simple-ish box circulates, ricochet to long wave</h2>\n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/136\">Isaac Banner</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: improper </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors balance &amp; swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">gentlespoons start a half hey - lefts in center, rights on ends  - gentlespoons ricochet to start, rather than crossing the set, <u>ladles</u> dance a standard half <u>hey</u></div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>0</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">form long waves - gentlespoons face in, ladles face out (right hands w/ <u>partners</u>)</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance &amp;  box circulate - gentlespoons cross while ladles loop right</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance &amp;  box circulate - ladles cross while gentlespoons loop right</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles chain to <u>neighbors</u></div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles start a half hey - rights in center, lefts on ends to <u>next neighbors</u> ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>\n"
